(text "UCC21710 IN+ = PWM_H_F, IN- = PWM_L_F (hardware interlock KR-GD-009); AIN tied to COM (CR-01); APWM not connected. UCC14141 VDD-VEE 19.0 V (107 k / 16.2 k) and COM-VEE 4.0 V (9.76 k / 16.2 k) give +15 V / -4 V at the gate; RLIM 1 k is a placeholder (human review). Decoupling sits between the driver pins and the gate/Kelvin connection (KR-PCB-002); KS_H is never joined to SW on the PCB (KR-PCB-003)." (at 12.7 22.86 0)
